{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "rashomon-stories",
  "chunk_id": "rashomon-stories-chunk-0997",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "长老亲切的微笑，首先跟我们寒暄了一下，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The elder smiled kindly and first exchanged greetings with us,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "接着静静的指了指正面的祭台：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then quietly pointed toward the altar in front of us:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“我真没什么为这位先生可效劳的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There is truly nothing I can do for this gentleman.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "正面祭台上的是‘生命之树’,",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What stands on the altar in front is the Tree of Life,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我们信徒们会对它顶礼膜拜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and we believers bow down before it in worship.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "你也看到了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As you have also seen,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "‘生命之树’上长着金色和绿色的果实。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "golden and green fruits grow on the Tree of Life.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "金色的果实被称作‘善果’，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The golden fruit is called the fruit of good,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00997",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "绿色的被称作‘恶果’……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and the green one is called the fruit of evil...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
